import ifcopenshell, ifcopenshell.geom, ifcopenshell.util.element as ue
f=ifcopenshell.open('output/model.ifc'); s=ifcopenshell.geom.settings(); s.set('use-world-coords',True)
def box(name):
    p=[e for e in f.by_type('IfcProduct') if e.Name==name][0]
    sh=ifcopenshell.geom.create_shape(s,p); v=sh.geometry.verts
    return (min(v[0::3])*1000,max(v[0::3])*1000,min(v[1::3])*1000,max(v[1::3])*1000)
for n in ['CRAH-A02','CRAH-B02','CRAH-D02','CRAH-C02','CRAH-C03']:
    print(n,box(n))
# list row elements sorted for A/B/D with x ranges
for row in 'ABD':
    items=[]
    for p in f.by_type('IfcProduct'):
        ps=ue.get_psets(p)
        for k in ('Pset_DCM_Rack','Pset_DCM_CRAH'):
            if k in ps and ps[k].get('Row')==row:
                b=box(p.Name); items.append((b[0],b[1],p.Name))
    print(row,sorted(items))
EOF

